# {{WORKSPACE_NAME}} — operating conventions

This file is read by your coding agent on every session start (hierarchy
load). It holds the conventions that apply across every project in this
workspace — not per-project detail (that belongs in each project's own
README, or in your agent's memory).

Your install agent drafted a real version of this file for you already
